<title>CANADA: Canada Q1 GDP price deflator rises 0.4 percent.</title>
<headline>Canada Q1 GDP price deflator rises 0.4 percent.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's implicit price index for calculation of gross domestic product at market prices rose 0.4 percent in the first quarter of 1997, to 130.7 (base 1986) after a 0.6 percent rise in the fourth quarter, Statistics Canada said on Monday.</p>
<p>Economists surveyed by Reuters had forecast a rise of 0.5 percent in the first quarter.</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau 613-235-6745)</p>
